lect Brainrots At Night 🌙\n🎮 How to Play? \n🧠 Steal Brainrots from Guards!\n⚡ Upgrade your speed and become faster \n🛡️ Stay alive and collect many Brainrots! \n\n💤Your Brainrots earn cash OFFLINE! \n👍Like the game and join the group for FREE EPIC BRAINROT!","path":"/game/76337761840610-steal-brainrots-at-night","slug":"76337761840610-steal-brainrots-at-night","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/097de4eef73cb725baf813fc4b8658cdbfc1a5a459d51ffcbd68c338c3fb54cf.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-eb90635bcd5687887ce28bc4999e1ea3/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":91,"visitor":20276030,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-06-03T10:28:59.062Z","creator":{"name":"Escapes With Studios","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":2,"freeCount":2,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":74161468227974,"name":"Five Nights: Hunted","desc":"💾 Things took a wicked turn. We were warned that the animatronics tend to get a bit quirky sometimes—but this? This was unexpected. I barely made it out alive. My friends, on the other hand, weren't so lucky..\n[ > recovered from video log #7 - corrupted data ]\n\n📂 Survivor Files:\nSurvive the night by completing objectives to unlock the blast doors, your only chance of escape. Will you ensure that everybody makes it out alive, or is it every man for himself?\n\n⚠️ Animatronics:\nIf it weren’t for them, you would’ve never turned into the monster you are today. \nNobody makes it out alive. \n\nOriginal by Scott Cawthon.\nThis fan-made unofficial game is created by huge fans as a tribute to celebrate the game and share our passion with the community.","path":"/game/74161468227974-five-nights-hunted","slug":"74161468227974-five-nights-hunted","thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/e0f0dae5773e02fa4d0bd8db5d2e35c92ff4f388d3630e5fed953ff92ad5d240.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-b4c559c06ebc94c33e2e30c98c522a81/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":91,"visitor":179880462,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-